This port is based on Freerouting source commit
aa909a3450d2de57cb7823f2098fe38c4af67769 (2026-09-25). Its algorithms, data
structures and file formats were translated from Java to Rust; comments of the
form "Java ClassName.method" refer to the Freerouting original.

